"A formula has an error for these people, so their payslips could not be "
"worked out. The rest were."
msgstr ""
"Sebuah rumus bermasalah untuk orang-orang ini, jadi slip gaji mereka tidak "
"dapat dihitung. Sisanya sudah dihitung."

