#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_retro/static/src/xml/retro_board.xml:0
msgid ""
"A pay rise entered late, a corrected allowance, a figure you want to try: "
"Payobook works the finished payslips out again with the scheme's own tax and"
" insurance formulas and shows every difference, person by person and month "
"by month."
msgstr ""
"Kenaikan gaji yang terlambat dimasukkan, tunjangan yang dikoreksi, angka "
"yang ingin Anda coba: Payobook menghitung ulang slip gaji yang sudah selesai"
" dengan rumus pajak dan asuransi skema itu sendiri dan menunjukkan setiap "
"selisih, per orang dan per bulan."

